# Display P3 Color Usage

Color base tokens in `packages/tokens` ship **two declarations per variable**:

```css
--eds-base: #020304;                                    /* sRGB fallback only */
--eds-base: color(display-p3 0.0078 0.0118 0.0157);     /* canonical value */
```

The **display-p3 line is the value to use**. The hex line exists only for browsers without `color(display-p3)` support.

## Rules

- **Always consume colors via CSS variables** (`var(--eds-*)`, `var(--text-*)`, `var(--material-*)`, `var(--effect-*)`). Never copy hex from `spec/` or `dist/` into component CSS.
- **Semantic / effect mixes** are built with `color-mix(in display-p3, var(--eds-*) …)` so alpha blends stay in the p3 pipeline.
- **Do not override token variables with sRGB-only hex** in component or app styles.
